 "text": "Three-phase drives\nThe standard three-phase AC drives are designed to work with a 3 x 400VAC power supply, allowing the output voltage to be regulated from 3 x 0-400VAC. On request we manufacture three-phase AC drives with regulation up to 3 x 0-450VAC as standard, with mains supply at 2 x 230VAC and special voltages.\n\nIn the same way, we can manufacture drives with any voltage and power range.\n\nExplore subcategories\nManual\nA control knob is used to operate the shaft, which in turn allows rotation of the graphite traveller by selecting the desired tension at any given moment.\nLearn more\nMotorized\nIt is mainly used to regulate equipment remotely or for stabilizing equipment. It is also recommended to motorize high power voltage variators, due to the ease of use they provide.\nLearn more\n\nTorivac-Products\n\n×\n\nProducts\n\nTransformers\n\n+\n\nConventional transformer\n\nToroidal transformers\n\nVoltage variators - Adjustable autotransformers\n\n+\n\nCustom manufacturing\n\nDesktop equipment\n\nDouble Variator\n\nRegulating accessories\n\nSingle Phase Inverters\n\nThree-phase drives\n\nVoltage stabilizers\n\n+\n\nAVS Series Stabilizers: electromechanical with servo motor\n\nBAVS Series: Electronics\n\nRheostats and coiled potentiometers\n\n+\n\nCeramic rheostats\n\nPotentiometers\n\nEncapsulated coils\n\n+\n\nRound\n\nSquares\n\nChokes | Inductances | Toroidal Reactances\n\n+\n\nNuclei\n\n+\n\nPortaled\n\n+\n\nled 10mm\n\nled 3mm\n\nled 5mm\n\nled 8mm\n\nSockets\n\n+\n\nHB4 socket\n\nHSR4 safety socket\n\nSafety socket HBS4\n\nsafety socket HR4\n\nControl buttons\n\n+\n\nArrow Discs\n\nArrow hoops\n\nBM series control buttons (Matte)\n\nBM Series Covers\n\nBO series control buttons (bright)\n\nBO Series control buttons with line\n\nBO series covers\n\nCasing covers\n\nEstators\n\nGraded covers\n\nGraduated discs\n\nResistors : Load banks\n\n+\n\nBoxed\n\nBraking resistors\n\nCemented\n\nGrounding resistors\n\nHelical\n\nLoad banks\n\nStarting resistors\n\nElectronic equipment\n\n+\n\nConverters\n\nDC power supplies\n\nIndustrial control\n\nRenewable energies",
